B.aeB=new A.aR(1,"\u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u062d\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0646\u064f","Ar-Rahman","Le Tout Mis\xe9ricordieux","The Most Merciful","Celui qui couvre l'univers entier de sa mis\xe9ricorde infinie, qui nourrit et pourvoit \xe0 tous les \xeatres cr\xe9\xe9s. C'est la mis\xe9ricorde englobante et g\xe9n\xe9rale qui s'\xe9tend avant m\xeame le m\xe9rite.","The One who encompasses the entire universe with infinite mercy, who nourishes and provides for all created beings. It is the encompassing and general mercy that extends even before deserving.","Celui qui r\xe9p\xe8te ce nom 100 fois le vendredi verra l'amour et l'affection se manifester dans son c\u0153ur et sa vie.","Whoever repeats this name 100 times on Friday will find love and affection manifesting in their heart and life.")
B.ael=new A.aR(2,"\u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u062d\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064f","Ar-Rahim","Le Tr\xe8s Mis\xe9ricordieux","The Compassionate","Celui qui manifeste sa mis\xe9ricorde particuli\xe8re envers ses serviteurs repentants et croyants. C'est la mis\xe9ricorde sp\xe9ciale accord\xe9e apr\xe8s les actes de d\xe9sob\xe9issance et de repentance sinc\xe8re.","The One who manifests particular mercy toward His repentant and believing servants. This is the special mercy granted after acts of disobedience and sincere repentance.","R\xe9citer ce nom avec intention sinc\xe8re apr\xe8s chaque acte r\xe9pr\xe9hensible attire le pardon et purifie l'\xe2me du serviteur.","Reciting this name with sincere intention after any blameworthy act attracts forgiveness and purifies the soul of the servant.")
B.aeG=new A.aR(3,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0644\u0650\u0643\u064f","Al-Malik","Le Souverain","The King","Celui qui r\xe8gne sur toute cr\xe9ation avec une autorit\xe9 absolue, dont le pouvoir ne peut \xeatre contest\xe9 et dont la royaut\xe9 n'a ni d\xe9but ni fin. Tout est soumis \xe0 son pouvoir et \xe0 sa domination.","The One who reigns over all creation with absolute authority, whose power cannot be challenged and whose kingdom has no beginning or end. Everything is subject to His power and domination.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom apaise le c\u0153ur des inqui\xe9tudes terrestres et renforce la confiance en la justice divine.","Meditating on this name soothes the heart from worldly worries and strengthens trust in divine justice.")
B.afE=new A.aR(4,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064f\u062f\u064f\u0651\u0648\u0633\u064f","Al-Quddus","Le Saint","The Holy","Celui qui est compl\xe8tement purifi\xe9 de tout d\xe9faut, imperfection et limitation. Il est au-del\xe0 de toute ressemblance avec la cr\xe9ation, absolument sacr\xe9 et transcendant.","The One who is completely free from all defects, imperfection, and limitation. He is beyond all resemblance to creation, absolutely sacred and transcendent.","Celui qui demande la purification spirituelle en r\xe9p\xe9tant ce nom verra son \xe2me s'\xe9lever et ses d\xe9fauts internes diminuer progressivement.","Those who ask for spiritual purification while repeating this name will see their soul elevated and internal faults diminish progressively.")
B.afg=new A.aR(5,"\u0627\u0644\u0633\u064e\u0651\u0644\u064e\u0627\u0645\u064f","As-Salam","La Paix","The Peace","Celui qui est la source de toute paix et s\xe9curit\xe9, qui pr\xe9serve sa cr\xe9ation de la destruction et de l'an\xe9antissement. Il accorde la s\xe9curit\xe9 \xe0 celui qui cherche son refuge.","The One who is the source of all peace and security, who preserves His creation from destruction and annihilation. He grants security to those who seek His refuge.","Celui qui dit ce nom chaque matin trouvera la s\xe9curit\xe9 et la tranquillit\xe9 \xe0 travers sa journ\xe9e malgr\xe9 les perturbations du monde.","Those who recite this name each morning will find security and tranquility throughout their day despite worldly disturbances.")
B.afM=new A.aR(6,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0624\u0652\u0645\u0650\u0646\u064f","Al-Moumen","Celui Qui Assure","The Grantor of Security","Celui qui pr\xe9serve ses cr\xe9atures et leurs croyances, qui est t\xe9moin de la v\xe9rit\xe9 et confirme les paroles v\xe9ridiques. Il est la source de confiance et d'assurance pour les croyants.","The One who preserves His creatures and their beliefs, who is a witness to truth and confirms truthful words. He is the source of trust and assurance for believers.","R\xe9citer ce nom augmente la foi et prot\xe8ge le croyant des doutes et de l'\xe9garement spirituel.","Reciting this name increases faith and protects the believer from doubts and spiritual misguidance.")
B.af2=new A.aR(7,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0632\u0650\u064a\u0632\u064f","Al-Aziz","Le Tout-Puissant","The Mighty","Celui dont la force et la puissance sont irr\xe9sistibles, dont personne ne peut vaincre ou surpasser. Son honneur et sa dignit\xe9 sont absolus et inviolables.","The One whose strength and power are irresistible, whom no one can overcome or surpass. His honor and dignity are absolute and inviolable.","Celui qui invoque ce nom avec sinc\xe9rit\xe9 sera aid\xe9 face \xe0 l'oppression et trouvera la force de surmonter les obstacles.","Those who invoke this name with sincerity will be helped against oppression and find the strength to overcome obstacles.")
B.afQ=new A.aR(8,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062c\u064e\u0628\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0631\u064f","Al-Jabbar","Le Contraignant","The Irresistible Force","Celui qui impose sa volont\xe9 avec puissance absolue, qui contraint et subjugue toute r\xe9bellion. C'est aussi celui qui r\xe9pare et restaure ce qui est bris\xe9 chez ses serviteurs.","The One who enforces His will with absolute power, who constrains and subdues all rebellion. He also repairs and restores what is broken in His servants.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom inspire l'humilit\xe9 devant la volont\xe9 divine et apaise la fiert\xe9 de l'\xe2me \xe9gotiste.","Meditating on this name inspires humility before divine will and soothes the pride of the ego-driven soul.")
B.afJ=new A.aR(9,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u062a\u064e\u0643\u064e\u0628\u0650\u0651\u0631\u064f","Al-Mutakabbir","Le Superbe","The Majestic","Celui qui poss\xe8de la grandeur supr\xeame et la majest\xe9 absolue, qui transcende toute cr\xe9ation par son essence. Il est au-del\xe0 de toute comparaison et de toute ressemblance.","The One who possesses supreme greatness and absolute majesty, who transcends all creation by His essence. He is beyond all comparison and resemblance.","R\xe9citer ce nom r\xe9guli\xe8rement purifie le c\u0153ur de l'orgueil et de la vantardise personnelle.","Regular recitation of this name purifies the heart from pride and personal arrogance.")
B.aeH=new A.aR(10,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062e\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0650\u0642\u064f","Al-Khaliq","Le Cr\xe9ateur","The Creator","Celui qui a cr\xe9\xe9 toute existence du n\xe9ant et qui continue \xe0 cr\xe9er sans cesse. Il est l'unique cr\xe9ateur dont aucune cr\xe9ation ne partage cette capacit\xe9 divine.","The One who created all existence from nothing and continues to create constantly. He is the unique Creator with whom no creation shares this divine capacity.","Celui qui m\xe9dite sur ce nom verra son \xe9merveillement face \xe0 la cr\xe9ation grandir et son c\u0153ur s'emplir de gratitude.","Those who meditate on this name will find their wonder at creation growing and their hearts filled with gratitude.")
B.afL=new A.aR(11,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064e\u0627\u0631\u0650\u0626\u064f","Al-Bari","L'Inventeur","The Inventor","Celui qui fa\xe7onne et invente les cr\xe9ations avec perfection et sagesse. Il donna \xe0 chaque cr\xe9ature sa forme et sa nature sp\xe9cifiques selon un dessein divin.","The One who shapes and invents creations with perfection and wisdom. He gives each creature its specific form and nature according to divine design.","R\xe9citer ce nom aide \xe0 accepter sa cr\xe9ation et son apparence avec contentement et reconnaissance.","Reciting this name helps in accepting one's creation and appearance with contentment and gratitude.")
B.aeC=new A.aR(12,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0635\u064e\u0648\u0650\u0651\u0631\u064f","Al-Musawwir","Le Formateur","The Fashioner","Celui qui donne la forme et l'apparence \xe0 toutes les cr\xe9atures avec harmonie et beaut\xe9. Il ne cesse de fa\xe7onner les formes conform\xe9ment \xe0 sa sagesse infinie.","The One who gives form and appearance to all creatures with harmony and beauty. He continuously shapes forms according to His infinite wisdom.","Celui qui invoque ce nom pour demander une am\xe9lioration personnelle verra son caract\xe8re et son apparence s'am\xe9liorer graduellement.","Those who invoke this name seeking self-improvement will see their character and appearance improve gradually.")
B.aeO=new A.aR(13,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u063a\u064e\u0641\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0631\u064f","Al-Ghaffar","Celui Qui Pardonne","The All-Forgiving","Celui qui efface et pardonne les p\xe9ch\xe9s de ses serviteurs \xe0 maintes reprises, malgr\xe9 leurs transgressions continuelles. Son pardon est vaste comme l'oc\xe9an.","The One who erases and forgives the sins of His servants repeatedly despite their continuous transgressions. His forgiveness is as vast as the ocean.","Celui qui se repent sinc\xe8rement en invoquant ce nom trouvera la paix de l'\xe2me et la lib\xe9ration du fardeau de la culpabilit\xe9.","Those who sincerely repent while invoking this name will find peace of soul and liberation from the burden of guilt.")
B.aeM=new A.aR(14,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064e\u0647\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0631\u064f","Al-Qahhar","Le Dominateur","The Subduer","Celui dont la domination absolue s'exerce sur toute cr\xe9ature qui ne peut lui r\xe9sister ou \xe9chapper \xe0 son pouvoir. Tous sont soumis \xe0 sa volont\xe9 irr\xe9sistible.","The One whose absolute dominion extends over all creatures who cannot resist or escape His power. All are subject to His irresistible will.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom renforce la conscience que toute puissance vient de Dieu et \xe9loigne la d\xe9pendance aux causes secondaires.","Meditating on this name strengthens awareness that all power comes from God and distances one from dependence on secondary causes.")
B.afo=new A.aR(15,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0647\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0628\u064f","Al-Wahhab","Celui Qui Donne","The Bestower","Celui qui donne g\xe9n\xe9reusement sans compter, dont les dons sont innombrables et continus. Il donne \xe0 qui il veut sans r\xe9tribution ou obligation.","The One who gives generously without measure, whose gifts are countless and continuous. He gives to whom He wills without recompense or obligation.","Celui qui invoque ce nom avec reconnaissance verra les bienfaits et les provisions se multiplier dans sa vie.","Those who invoke this name with gratitude will see blessings and provisions multiply in their life.")
B.af6=new A.aR(16,"\u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u0632\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0642\u064f","Ar-Razzaq","Celui Qui Pourvoit","The Provider","Celui qui nourrit et pourvoit \xe0 la subsistance de toute cr\xe9ature. Il est la source de toute provision et de tout b\xe9n\xe9fice dans ce monde et l'autre.","The One who nourishes and provides sustenance for all creatures. He is the source of all provision and benefit in this world and the next.","R\xe9citer ce nom avec confiance et sinc\xe9rit\xe9 attire la subsistance et \xe9loigne la pauvret\xe9 et l'inqui\xe9tude mat\xe9rielle.","Reciting this name with trust and sincerity attracts provision and removes poverty and material anxiety.")
B.afw=new A.aR(17,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0641\u064e\u062a\u064e\u0651\u0627\u062d\u064f","Al-Fattah","L'Ouvreur","The Opener","Celui qui ouvre les portes du succ\xe8s, de la connaissance et du pardon. Il tranche entre les cr\xe9atures en jugement et d\xe9verrouille les myst\xe8res de l'existence.","The One who opens the doors of success, knowledge, and forgiveness. He judges between creatures and unlocks the mysteries of existence.","Celui qui r\xe9cite ce nom en d\xe9but de jour verra les portes des opportunit\xe9s et des solutions s'ouvrir devant lui.","Those who recite this name at the start of the day will see doors of opportunities and solutions opening before them.")
B.af7=new A.aR(18,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0644\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064f","Al-Alim","L'Omniscient","The All-Knowing","Celui dont la science englobe tous les choses, du pass\xe9 jusqu'au futur, du visible \xe0 l'invisible. Sa connaissance est absolue et sans limite.","The One whose knowledge encompasses all things, from the past to the future, from the visible to the invisible. His knowledge is absolute and without limit.","Celui qui m\xe9dite sur ce nom prend conscience que rien ne peut lui \xeatre cach\xe9 de Dieu et cela renforce son int\xe9grit\xe9 morale.","Those who meditate on this name become aware that nothing can be hidden from God, strengthening their moral integrity.")
B.afb=new A.aR(19,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064e\u0627\u0628\u0650\u0636\u064f","Al-Qabid","Celui Qui Restreint","The Constrictor","Celui qui restreint les provisions et les bienfaits selon sa sagesse, et qui peut retirer ce qu'il a accord\xe9. Cette restriction peut \xeatre un test ou une mis\xe9ricorde cach\xe9e.","The One who restricts provisions and blessings according to His wisdom and can withdraw what He has granted. This restriction may be a test or hidden mercy.","Accepter ce nom avec patience renforce la contentement et prot\xe8ge le c\u0153ur de l'avidit\xe9 et du d\xe9sir immod\xe9r\xe9.","Accepting this name with patience strengthens contentment and protects the heart from greed and excessive desire.")
B.af4=new A.aR(20,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064e\u0627\u0633\u0650\u0637\u064f","Al-Basit","Celui Qui \xc9tend","The Expander","Celui qui \xe9tend et augmente les provisions et les bienfaits selon sa volont\xe9. Il donne l'expansion et la largeur \xe0 celui qui il veut favori.","The One who expands and increases provisions and blessings according to His will. He gives expansion and abundance to whom He chooses to favor.","Invoquer ce nom attire l'abundance et l'aisance mat\xe9rielle et spirituelle dans la vie du serviteur.","Invoking this name attracts abundance and ease, both material and spiritual, into the servant's life.")
B.afe=new A.aR(21,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062e\u064e\u0627\u0641\u0650\u0636\u064f","Al-Khafid","Celui Qui Abaisse","The Abaser","Celui qui abaisse l'orgueilleux et l'arrogant, qui rabaisse celui qui s'\xe9l\xe8ve injustement. C'est aussi celui qui abaisse les rangs des p\xe9cheurs imp\xe9nitents.","The One who abases the proud and arrogant, who lowers those who unjustly exalt themselves. He also lowers the ranks of impenitent sinners.","Celui qui tient ce nom en m\xe9moire verra son orgueil diminuer et son c\u0153ur s'incliner dans l'humilit\xe9 devant la divinit\xe9.","Those who keep this name in mind will see their pride diminish and their heart bow in humility before divinity.")
B.afk=new A.aR(22,"\u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0641\u0650\u0639\u064f","Ar-Rafi","Celui Qui \xc9l\xe8ve","The Exalter","Celui qui \xe9l\xe8ve le rang des croyants sinc\xe8res et des ob\xe9issants, qui augmente leur dignit\xe9 et leur honneur. Il \xe9l\xe8ve aussi les \xe2mes vers la perfection spirituelle.","The One who raises the rank of sincere believers and the obedient, who increases their dignity and honor. He also elevates souls toward spiritual perfection.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom inspire le d\xe9sir d'am\xe9lioration personnelle et d'ascension spirituelle constante.","Meditating on this name inspires desire for self-improvement and constant spiritual ascension.")
B.afs=new A.aR(23,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0639\u0650\u0632\u064f\u0651","Al-Muiz","Celui Qui Honore","The Bestower of Honor","Celui qui conf\xe8re l'honneur et la dignit\xe9 \xe0 qui il veut. Son honneur accord\xe9 ne peut \xeatre diminu\xe9 par personne d'autre.","The One who grants honor and dignity to whomever He wills. The honor He gives cannot be diminished by anyone else.","Invoquer ce nom avec sinc\xe9rit\xe9 apporte l'honneur v\xe9ritable qui ne d\xe9pend pas du jugement des hommes.","Invoking this name with sincerity brings true honor that does not depend on the judgment of people.")
B.afn=new A.aR(24,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0630\u0650\u0644\u064f\u0651","Al-Mudhill","Celui Qui Humilie","The Humiliator","Celui qui abaisse celui qui devient arrogant et orgueilleux. Son humiliation peut \xeatre une correction ou un test pour rectifier la conduite du serviteur.","The One who humbles those who become arrogant and proud. His humiliation may be a correction or a test to rectify the servant's conduct.","Accepter ce nom avec sagesse prot\xe8ge du destin des arrogants et maintient l'humilit\xe9 du c\u0153ur.","Accepting this name with wisdom protects from the fate of the arrogant and maintains humility of heart.")
B.afI=new A.aR(25,"\u0627\u0644\u0633\u064e\u0651\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0639\u064f","As-Sami","L'Audient","The All-Hearing","Celui qui entend toutes les paroles et les invocations de ses cr\xe9atures, m\xeame chuchot\xe9es secr\xe8tement. Son ou\xefe englobe tout et ne manque rien.","The One who hears all words and invocations of His creatures, even those whispered in secret. His hearing encompasses everything and misses nothing.","Celui qui sait que Dieu l'\xe9coute toujours parlera avec sagesse et purifiera son discours de la m\xe9disance.","Those who know God is always listening will speak with wisdom and purify their speech from backbiting.")
B.af5=new A.aR(26,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064e\u0635\u0650\u064a\u0631\u064f","Al-Basir","Le Voyant","The All-Seeing","Celui qui voit tout ce qui existe, du plus grand au plus petit, du cach\xe9 au manifeste. Sa vision p\xe9n\xe8tre toutes les profondeurs et aucun secret ne lui est dissimul\xe9.","The One who sees all that exists, from the greatest to the smallest, from the hidden to the manifest. His sight penetrates all depths and no secret is hidden from Him.","Sachant que Dieu le voit toujours, le serviteur s'abstiendra de l'interdit et cultivera les bonnes actions.","Knowing that God always sees him, the servant will refrain from the forbidden and cultivate good deeds.")
B.aet=new A.aR(27,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0643\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064f","Al-Hakim","Le Sage","The All-Wise","Celui dont la sagesse est absolue et parfaite en toutes choses. Chacun de ses actes, ses commandements et ses d\xe9crets refl\xe8tent une sagesse cach\xe9e et profonde.","The One whose wisdom is absolute and perfect in all things. Each of His acts, commandments, and decrees reflects hidden and profound wisdom.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom enseigne l'acceptation des d\xe9crets divins m\xeame quand la sagesse en est cach\xe9e \xe0 la raison humaine.","Meditating on this name teaches acceptance of divine decrees even when their wisdom is hidden from human reason.")
B.aew=new A.aR(28,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0638\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064f","Al-Azim","Le Magnifique","The Magnificent","Celui dont la grandeur et la magnificence surpassent toute conception. Sa gloire englobe tout et rien ne peut lui \xeatre \xe9gal\xe9 en sublimit\xe9.","The One whose greatness and magnificence surpass all conception. His glory encompasses everything and nothing can be equal to Him in sublimity.","R\xe9citer ce nom rend humble et remplit l'\xe2me d'une admiration profonde pour la grandeur divine.","Reciting this name humbles the soul and fills it with profound admiration for divine greatness.")
B.aer=new A.aR(29,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u063a\u064e\u0641\u064f\u0648\u0631\u064f","Al-Ghafur","Celui Qui Pardonne","The All-Pardoning","Celui qui pardonne les p\xe9ch\xe9s malgr\xe9 leur nombre et leur gravit\xe9, et qui voile les fautes de ses serviteurs. Son pardon couvre tout pour celui qui se repent.","The One who pardons sins despite their number and severity, and who conceals the faults of His servants. His forgiveness covers all for those who repent.","Celui qui confesse ses p\xe9ch\xe9s en invoquant ce nom trouvera l'absolution et la paix int\xe9rieure restaur\xe9e.","Those who confess their sins while invoking this name will find absolution and restored inner peace.")
B.aeo=new A.aR(30,"\u0627\u0644\u0634\u064e\u0651\u0643\u064f\u0648\u0631\u064f","Ash-Shakur","Celui Qui R\xe9compense","The Appreciative","Celui qui reconna\xeet et r\xe9compense g\xe9n\xe9reusement les bonnes actions, m\xeame les plus petites. Il multiplie les r\xe9compenses et ne permet pas que l'effort sinc\xe8re soit perdu.","The One who acknowledges and generously rewards good deeds, even the smallest ones. He multiplies rewards and does not allow sincere effort to be lost.","Celui qui remercie Dieu sinc\xe8rement verra ses bienfaits se multiplier et sa gratitude renforc\xe9e continuellement.","Those who thank God sincerely will see their blessings multiply and their gratitude continuously strengthened.")
B.aej=new A.aR(31,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0644\u0650\u064a\u064f\u0651","Al-Ali","Le Tr\xe8s-Haut","The Most High","Celui qui est au-dessus de toute cr\xe9ation tant en essence qu'en pouvoir et en sagesse. Son \xe9l\xe9vation est absolue et rien ne s'\xe9gale \xe0 sa hauteur.","The One who is above all creation in essence, power, and wisdom. His elevation is absolute and nothing can compare to His supremacy.","Celui qui contemple ce nom reconna\xeet la limite de sa propre condition et renforce son besoin de proximit\xe9 avec le divin.","Those who contemplate this name recognize the limits of their own condition and strengthen their need for closeness with the divine.")
B.aeS=new A.aR(32,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0643\u064e\u0628\u0650\u064a\u0631\u064f","Al-Kabir","Le Grand","The Great","Celui dont la grandeur est infinie et incommensurable. Toute grandeur cr\xe9\xe9e est insignifiante compar\xe9e \xe0 la grandeur divine.","The One whose greatness is infinite and incomparable. All created greatness is insignificant compared to divine greatness.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom apaise les soucis terrestres en rappelant que toute difficult\xe9 est petite face \xe0 la grandeur de Dieu.","Meditating on this name soothes worldly worries by reminding that all difficulty is small in the face of God's greatness.")
B.afm=new A.aR(33,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0641\u0650\u064a\u0638\u064f","Al-Hafiz","Le Pr\xe9servateur","The Preserver","Celui qui pr\xe9serve et garde toute cr\xe9ation du changement, de la destruction et de l'oubli. Il prot\xe8ge ses serviteurs croyants de tous les malheurs.","The One who preserves and guards all creation from change, destruction, and oblivion. He protects His believing servants from all harm.","Celui qui confie ses affaires \xe0 ce nom sera prot\xe9g\xe9 et pr\xe9serv\xe9 de tout mal par la gr\xe2ce divine.","Those who entrust their affairs to this name will be protected and preserved from all harm by divine grace.")
B.aeX=new A.aR(34,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0642\u0650\u064a\u062a\u064f","Al-Muqit","Celui Qui Nourrit","The Maintainer","Celui qui nourrit et soutient toute existence, qui pourvoit aux besoins de chaque cr\xe9ature. Il est la source continue de subsistance et de force.","The One who sustains and maintains all existence, who provides for the needs of every creature. He is the continuous source of sustenance and strength.","Invoquer ce nom attire les provisions suffisantes et renforce la confiance en l'entretien de Dieu pour le serviteur.","Invoking this name attracts sufficient provisions and strengthens trust in God's maintenance of the servant.")
B.aeu=new A.aR(35,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0633\u0650\u064a\u0628\u064f","Al-Hasib","Celui Qui Compte","The Reckoner","Celui qui compte les actes de ses serviteurs et les conna\xeet en d\xe9tail, qui sera suffisant le Jour du Jugement. Il suffit comme t\xe9moin et comme juge.","The One who reckons the deeds of His servants and knows them in detail, who will be sufficient on the Day of Judgment. He is sufficient as witness and judge.","Celui qui sait que Dieu compte ses actes r\xe9v\xe8lera son intention en chaque affaire et purifiera ses motivations.","Those who know God reckons their deeds will reveal their intention in every matter and purify their motivations.")
B.aeq=new A.aR(36,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062c\u064e\u0644\u0650\u064a\u0644\u064f","Al-Jalil","Le Majestueux","The Majestic","Celui dont la majest\xe9 et la splendeur inspirent la crainte r\xe9v\xe9rencielle. Sa majest\xe9 transcende toute conception de grandeur cr\xe9\xe9e.","The One whose majesty and splendor inspire reverent fear. His majesty transcends all conception of created greatness.","Contempler ce nom remplit le c\u0153ur d'une crainte respectueuse qui purifie l'\xe2me de la r\xe9bellion.","Contemplating this name fills the heart with reverent fear that purifies the soul from rebellion.")
B.aeN=new A.aR(37,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0643\u064e\u0631\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064f","Al-Karim","Le G\xe9n\xe9reux","The Generous","Celui dont la g\xe9n\xe9rosit\xe9 est infinie et in\xe9puisable, qui donne sans mesure. Sa noblesse et sa magnanimit\xe9 se manifestent dans chacun de ses bienfaits.","The One whose generosity is infinite and inexhaustible, who gives without measure. His nobility and magnanimity manifest in every single blessing.","Celui qui demande avec sinc\xe9rit\xe9 en invoquant ce nom verra la g\xe9n\xe9rosit\xe9 divine s'accumuler dans sa vie.","Those who ask sincerely while invoking this name will see divine generosity accumulate in their life.")
B.aex=new A.aR(38,"\u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u0642\u0650\u064a\u0628\u064f","Ar-Raqib","Le Surveillant","The Watchful","Celui qui surveille toutes les cr\xe9atures et observe tous leurs actes, secrets et manifestes. Rien ne peut lui \xe9chapper ou lui \xeatre cach\xe9.","The One who watches all creatures and observes all their deeds, secret and open. Nothing can escape Him or be hidden from Him.","Sachant qu'il est observ\xe9 par Dieu, le serviteur mod\xe8rera ses actes et cultivera la sinc\xe9rit\xe9 en toutes circonstances.","Knowing he is observed by God, the servant will moderate his deeds and cultivate sincerity in all circumstances.")
B.afi=new A.aR(39,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u062c\u0650\u064a\u0628\u064f","Al-Mujib","Celui Qui Exauce","The Responder","Celui qui exauce les invocations et les demandes sinc\xe8res de ses serviteurs. Il \xe9coute et r\xe9pond \xe0 celui qui l'appelle avec un c\u0153ur sinc\xe8re.","The One who answers the invocations and sincere requests of His servants. He listens and responds to those who call upon Him with a sincere heart.","Celui qui invoque ce nom avec sinc\xe9rit\xe9 et confiance verra ses pri\xe8res exauc\xe9es selon ce qui est mieux pour lui.","Those who invoke this name with sincerity and trust will see their prayers answered according to what is best for them.")
B.aev=new A.aR(40,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0627\u0633\u0650\u0639\u064f","Al-Wasi","L'Infini","The All-Encompassing","Celui dont la science, la puissance et la mis\xe9ricorde englobent tout. Son infini transcende toute limite cr\xe9\xe9e.","The One whose knowledge, power, and mercy encompass everything. His infinity transcends all created limits.","Celui qui m\xe9dite sur ce nom trouvera la consolation en sachant que l'aide de Dieu est aussi vaste que ses difficult\xe9s.","Those who meditate on this name will find consolation knowing that God's help is as vast as their difficulties.")
B.afy=new A.aR(41,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0643\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064f","Al-Hakim","Le Sage","The All-Wise","Celui dont la sagesse est absolue dans ses d\xe9crets et ses actes. Chaque choix divin refl\xe8te une profonde sagesse souvent cach\xe9e \xe0 la raison humaine.","The One whose wisdom is absolute in His decrees and acts. Each divine choice reflects deep wisdom often hidden from human reason.","Accepter ce nom avec confiance apaise le c\u0153ur lors des \xe9preuves en se souvenant que la sagesse divine en transcende les apparences.","Accepting this name with trust soothes the heart during trials by remembering that divine wisdom transcends their appearance.")
B.aeU=new A.aR(42,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0648\u064e\u062f\u064f\u0648\u062f\u064f","Al-Wadud","Celui Qui Aime","The Loving","Celui dont l'amour pour ses serviteurs pieux est constant et profond. C'est aussi celui qui inspire l'amour et la tendresse entre ses cr\xe9atures.","The One whose love for His pious servants is constant and deep. He is also the One who inspires love and tenderness between His creatures.","Celui qui invoque ce nom avec un c\u0153ur pur attirera l'amour et l'affection sinc\xe8re des gens et de la part de Dieu.","Those who invoke this name with a pure heart will attract sincere love and affection from people and from God.")
B.afr=new A.aR(43,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064e\u062c\u0650\u064a\u062f\u064f","Al-Majid","Le Glorieux","The Glorious","Celui dont la gloire et l'honneur sont supr\xeames et inviolables. Sa magnificence engendre la gloire de toute cr\xe9ation.","The One whose glory and honor are supreme and inviolable. His magnificence generates the glory of all creation.","R\xe9citer ce nom honore le serviteur et \xe9l\xe8ve son statut parmi les cr\xe9atures tout en lui rappelant que toute gloire \xe9mane de Dieu.","Reciting this name honors the servant and elevates his status among creatures while reminding him that all glory emanates from God.")
B.afS=new A.aR(44,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064e\u0627\u0639\u0650\u062b\u064f","Al-Baes","Celui Qui Ressuscite","The Resurrector","Celui qui ressuscitera tous les hommes le Jour du Jugement Dernier. C'est aussi celui qui suscite le bien et la guidance chez ses serviteurs.","The One who will resurrect all people on the Day of Final Judgment. He is also the One who awakens goodness and guidance in His servants.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom renforce la foi au Jugement Dernier et encourage l'action vertueuse pour la vie \xe9ternelle.","Meditating on this name strengthens faith in the Day of Judgment and encourages virtuous action for eternal life.")
B.aes=new A.aR(45,"\u0627\u0644\u0634\u064e\u0651\u0647\u0650\u064a\u062f\u064f","Ash-Shahid","Le T\xe9moin","The Witness","Celui qui est t\xe9moin de tous les actes et paroles des cr\xe9atures. Il sera le t\xe9moin supr\xeame le Jour du Jugement contre ou en faveur de chacun.","The One who is a witness to all deeds and words of creatures. He will be the supreme witness on the Day of Judgment for or against each person.","Sachant que Dieu est t\xe9moin de ses actes, le serviteur maintiendra l'int\xe9grit\xe9 morale en toute circonstance.","Knowing that God is a witness to his deeds, the servant will maintain moral integrity in all circumstances.")
B.aeE=new A.aR(46,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0642\u064f\u0651","Al-Haq","La V\xe9rit\xe9","The Truth","Celui qui est la V\xe9rit\xe9 absolue et dont toute v\xe9rit\xe9 \xe9mane. L'existence m\xeame d\xe9pend de sa v\xe9rit\xe9 incontestable.","The One who is absolute Truth and from whom all truth emanates. Existence itself depends on His undeniable truth.","Celui qui recherche la v\xe9rit\xe9 sinc\xe8rement sera guid\xe9 vers le chemin droit par la guidance de ce nom divin.","Those who sincerely seek truth will be guided toward the straight path by the guidance of this divine name.")
B.afF=new A.aR(47,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0643\u0650\u064a\u0644\u064f","Al-Wakil","Celui Qui Pourvoit","The Trustee","Celui sur qui on place sa confiance absolue et \xe0 qui on confie ses affaires. Il s'occupe des int\xe9r\xeats de celui qui se confie \xe0 Lui.","The One upon whom absolute trust is placed and to whom affairs are entrusted. He takes care of the interests of those who trust in Him.","Celui qui remet ses affaires enti\xe8rement \xe0 Dieu en invoquant ce nom trouvera la paix de l'\xe2me et le succ\xe8s.","Those who fully entrust their affairs to God while invoking this name will find peace of soul and success.")
B.aeF=new A.aR(48,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064e\u0648\u0650\u064a\u064f\u0651","Al-Qawi","Le Puissant","The Strong","Celui dont la force et la puissance sont absolues et irresistibles. Aucune force cr\xe9\xe9e ne peut s'opposer \xe0 sa puissance.","The One whose strength and power are absolute and irresistible. No created force can oppose His power.","Invoquer ce nom renforce le serviteur face aux d\xe9fis de la vie en lui rappelant qu'il peut puiser dans la puissance divine.","Invoking this name strengthens the servant in facing life's challenges by reminding him he can draw upon divine strength.")
B.af9=new A.aR(49,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064e\u062a\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064f","Al-Matin","Le Tr\xe8s-Fort","The Unshakeable","Celui dont la force est extr\xeamement ferme et in\xe9branlable. Sa fermet\xe9 absolue soutient tout l'univers sans jamais fl\xe9chir.","The One whose strength is extremely firm and unshakeable. His absolute firmness sustains the entire universe without ever wavering.","Celui qui demande la fermet\xe9 de conviction en invoquant ce nom renforcera sa foi face aux tentations et aux doutes.","Those who ask for firmness of conviction while invoking this name will strengthen their faith against temptations and doubts.")
B.af_=new A.aR(50,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0644\u0650\u064a\u064f\u0651","Al-Wali","Le Protecteur","The Protector","Celui qui prot\xe8ge et soutient ses croyants, qui est leur alli\xe9 et leur auxiliaire. Il est plus proche du serviteur que lui-m\xeame.","The One who protects and supports His believers, who is their ally and helper. He is closer to the servant than himself.","Celui qui prend ce nom pour protecteur sera gard\xe9 de tout mal et trouvera l'assistance divine dans les moments critiques.","Those who take this name as their protector will be guarded from all harm and find divine assistance in critical moments.")
B.aeQ=new A.aR(51,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0645\u0650\u064a\u062f\u064f","Al-Hamid","Le Louang\xe9","The Praiseworthy","Celui qui est digne de louanges absolues et perp\xe9tuelles malgr\xe9 la pr\xe9sence ou l'absence de cr\xe9atures pour le louer. Toute existence le loue.","The One who is worthy of absolute and perpetual praise regardless of whether creatures praise Him or not. All existence praises Him.","Celui qui loue ce nom r\xe9guli\xe8rement verra la gratitude se multiplier dans son c\u0153ur et embellira sa relation avec le cr\xe9ateur.","Those who regularly praise this name will see gratitude multiply in their heart and beautify their relationship with the Creator.")
B.afO=new A.aR(52,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u062d\u0652\u0635\u0650\u064a","Al-Muhsi","Celui Qui Compte","The Enumerator","Celui qui d\xe9nombre tous les \xe9l\xe9ments cr\xe9\xe9s, du grain de sable \xe0 l'\xe9toile. Chaque cr\xe9ature est connue par Lui en nombre et en d\xe9tail.","The One who numbers all created elements, from the grain of sand to the star. Every creature is known to Him in number and detail.","Ce nom rappelle que rien ne s'\xe9chappe au compte de Dieu, inspirant la conscience morale et l'honn\xeatet\xe9.","This name reminds us that nothing escapes God's reckoning, inspiring moral conscience and honesty.")
B.af3=new A.aR(53,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0628\u0652\u062f\u0650\u0626\u064f","Al-Mubdi","Celui Qui Cr\xe9e Initialement","The Originator","Celui qui cr\xe9e les choses la premi\xe8re fois en les amenant du n\xe9ant \xe0 l'existence. C'est le d\xe9but de toute cr\xe9ation.","The One who creates things for the first time, bringing them from non-existence to existence. This is the origin of all creation.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom inspire l'\xe9merveillement devant la cr\xe9ation originelle et renforce la confiance en la puissance cr\xe9atrice.","Meditating on this name inspires wonder at original creation and strengthens trust in the creating power.")
B.af1=new A.aR(54,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0639\u0650\u064a\u062f\u064f","Al-Mueed","Celui Qui Restaure","The Restorer","Celui qui ram\xe8ne les choses \xe0 l'existence apr\xe8s leur destruction ou mort. Il renouvelle et restaure continuellement la cr\xe9ation.","The One who brings things back to existence after their destruction or death. He continuously renews and restores creation.","Invoquer ce nom apaise les craintes de la mort en se souvenant que la r\xe9surrection est aussi certainement possible que la cr\xe9ation.","Invoking this name soothes fears of death by remembering that resurrection is as surely possible as creation.")
B.aeJ=new A.aR(55,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u062d\u0652\u064a\u0650\u064a","Al-Muhyi","Celui Qui Vivifie","The Giver of Life","Celui qui donne la vie \xe0 la mati\xe8re inerte et qui vivifie l'\xe2me par la foi et la guidance. Il est source de vie \xe9ternelle.","The One who gives life to lifeless matter and vivifies the soul through faith and guidance. He is the source of eternal life.","Celui qui demande la vivification du c\u0153ur en invoquant ce nom verra sa vie spirituelle s'enrichir et son \xe9nergie se renouveler.","Those who ask for the vivification of their heart while invoking this name will see their spiritual life enriched and their energy renewed.")
B.afl=new A.aR(56,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0645\u0650\u064a\u062a\u064f","Al-Mumit","Celui Qui Cause la Mort","The Giver of Death","Celui qui \xf4te la vie et cause la mort de toute cr\xe9ature vivante. La mort n'existe que par sa volont\xe9 et son pouvoir.","The One who takes away life and causes the death of every living creature. Death exists only through His will and power.","Accepter ce nom avec sagesse apaise la peur de la mort en la reconnaissant comme une transition vers une autre existence.","Accepting this name with wisdom soothes fear of death by recognizing it as a transition to another existence.")
B.aeD=new A.aR(57,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u064a\u064f\u0651","Al-Hayy","Le Vivant","The Ever-Living","Celui qui poss\xe8de la vie \xe9ternelle en lui-m\xeame sans d\xe9pendre d'une source externe. Sa vie est absolue et in\xe9puisable.","The One who possesses eternal life within Himself without depending on an external source. His life is absolute and inexhaustible.","R\xe9citer ce nom purifie le c\u0153ur en le connectant \xe0 la source \xe9ternelle de vie et en lib\xe9rant la peur de l'extinction.","Reciting this name purifies the heart by connecting it to the eternal source of life and freeing it from fear of extinction.")
B.aeV=new A.aR(58,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064e\u064a\u064f\u0651\u0648\u0645\u064f","Al-Qayyum","L'Autosuffisant","The Self-Subsisting","Celui qui subsiste par lui-m\xeame et dont l'existence d\xe9pend uniquement de sa propre essence. Toute autre existence d\xe9pend de Lui.","The One who subsists by Himself and whose existence depends only on His own essence. All other existence depends on Him.","Celui qui m\xe9dite sur ce nom comprendra que toute d\xe9pendance cr\xe9\xe9e provient ultimement de Dieu et non des autres.","Those who meditate on this name will understand that all created dependence ultimately comes from God and not from others.")
B.afD=new A.aR(59,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0648\u0650\u062a\u0652\u0631\u064f","Al-Witr","L'Unique","The Odd One","Celui qui est sans \xe9gal et sans pareil, l'unique en essence, attributs et actions. Il n'a ni associ\xe9 ni similaire.","The One who is without equal and peerless, unique in essence, attributes, and actions. He has no partner or equivalent.","Ce nom prot\xe8ge celui qui le r\xe9cite de la tendance \xe0 associer d'autres \xe0 Dieu et renforce l'unicit\xe9 divine dans le c\u0153ur.","This name protects those who recite it from the tendency to associate others with God and strengthens divine uniqueness in the heart.")
B.afK=new A.aR(60,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0641\u064e\u0631\u0652\u062f\u064f","Al-Fard","L'Unique","The Singular","Celui qui est seul et isol\xe9 dans son pouvoir, sa domination et ses attributs. Nul ne peut le \xe9galer ou le partager dans sa divinit\xe9.","The One who is alone and isolated in His power, dominion, and attributes. No one can equal or share in His divinity.","Invoquer ce nom renforce l'isolement spirituel du serviteur de tout ce qui n'est pas Dieu et purifie son intention.","Invoking this name strengthens the servant's spiritual detachment from everything other than God and purifies his intention.")
B.afR=new A.aR(61,"\u0627\u0644\u0635\u064e\u0651\u0645\u064e\u062f\u064f","As-Samad","L'Immuable","The Eternal","Celui qui est sans besoin, autosuffisant et immuable. Tous ont besoin de Lui mais Lui n'a besoin de personne.","The One who is in need of nothing, self-sufficient and unchanging. Everyone needs Him but He needs no one.","Celui qui comprend ce nom d\xe9couvre la vanit\xe9 des richesses terrestres et dirige son c\u0153ur vers la vraie suffisance en Dieu.","Those who understand this name discover the vanity of earthly riches and direct their heart toward true sufficiency in God.")
B.aek=new A.aR(62,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064e\u0627\u062f\u0650\u0631\u064f","Al-Qadir","Le Capable","The Able","Celui qui poss\xe8de une puissance absolue sur tous les choses et dont le pouvoir ne conna\xeet aucune limite. Rien ne d\xe9passe sa capacit\xe9.","The One who possesses absolute power over all things and whose power knows no limit. Nothing surpasses His capacity.","Celui qui invoque ce nom avec confiance en cas de difficult\xe9 verra l'impossible devenir possible par la gr\xe2ce divine.","Those who invoke this name with confidence during hardship will see the impossible become possible through divine grace.")
B.afC=new A.aR(63,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0642\u0652\u062a\u064e\u062f\u0650\u0631\u064f","Al-Muqtadir","Celui Qui a le Pouvoir","The All-Powerful","Celui qui dispose d'un pouvoir et d'une puissance manifeste et compl\xe8te. Son pouvoir s'\xe9tend sur tout sans nuance ni limitation.","The One who possesses evident and complete power and might. His power extends over everything without qualification or limitation.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom renforce la confiance du serviteur en l'aide divine et dissipe les doutes concernant sa capacit\xe9 \xe0 surmonter les obstacles.","Meditating on this name strengthens the servant's confidence in divine aid and dispels doubts about his ability to overcome obstacles.")
B.afx=new A.aR(64,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0639\u064e\u062c\u0650\u0651\u0644\u064f","Al-Mou'ajjil","Celui Qui Acc\xe9l\xe8re","The Expediter","Celui qui avance et acc\xe9l\xe8re l'arriv\xe9e des choses selon sa sagesse. Il peut acc\xe9l\xe9rer la punition ou la r\xe9compense de celui qu'il veut.","The One who brings forward and expedites the arrival of things according to His wisdom. He can hasten punishment or reward for whom He wills.","Accepter ce nom avec patience apaise l'inqui\xe9tude concernant le moment de l'arriv\xe9e de la provision ou de la r\xe9compense.","Accepting this name with patience soothes anxiety about when provision or reward will arrive.")
B.aeL=new A.aR(65,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0624\u064e\u062e\u0650\u0651\u0631\u064f","Al-Moakhkhir","Celui Qui Retarde","The Delayer","Celui qui retarde et ajourne les choses selon son plan divin. Il diff\xe8re parfois ce qui semble urgent pour une sagesse cach\xe9e.","The One who delays and postpones things according to His divine plan. He sometimes defers what seems urgent for hidden wisdom.","Celui qui accepte les retards en invoquant ce nom trouvera la sagesse dans l'attente et d\xe9veloppera la patience vertueuse.","Those who accept delays while invoking this name will find wisdom in waiting and develop virtuous patience.")
B.afq=new A.aR(66,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0623\u064e\u0648\u064e\u0651\u0644\u064f","Al-Awal","Le Premier","The First","Celui qui existe avant tout, sans commencement \xe0 son existence. Il est ant\xe9rieur \xe0 toute cr\xe9ation.","The One who exists before everything, without beginning to His existence. He is prior to all creation.","Ce nom rappelle que toute chose nouvelle commence apr\xe8s Dieu, ancrant la conscience de la d\xe9pendance primordiale.","This name reminds us that everything new begins after God, anchoring awareness of primordial dependence.")
B.afu=new A.aR(67,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0622\u062e\u0650\u0631\u064f","Al-Akhir","Le Dernier","The Last","Celui qui demeurera apr\xe8s la disparition de toute cr\xe9ation. Il est la destination finale et la fin de tout.","The One who will remain after the disappearance of all creation. He is the final destination and the end of all things.","R\xe9citer ce nom pr\xe9pare l'\xe2me \xe0 l'Au-del\xe0 et maintient la conscience que le vrai succ\xe8s r\xe9side dans l'\xe9ternit\xe9 avec Dieu.","Reciting this name prepares the soul for the afterlife and maintains awareness that true success lies in eternity with God.")
B.afN=new A.aR(68,"\u0627\u0644\u0638\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0647\u0650\u0631\u064f","Az-Zahir","Le Manifeste","The Manifest","Celui qui est apparent et visible dans ses signes et ses cr\xe9ations, bien que son essence reste transcendante. Son existence et sa puissance sont manifestes.","The One who is apparent and visible in His signs and creations, though His essence remains transcendent. His existence and power are manifest.","Celui qui m\xe9dite sur ce nom percevra les signes de Dieu dans la cr\xe9ation et raffinera son observation spirituelle.","Those who meditate on this name will perceive the signs of God in creation and refine their spiritual observation.")
B.aeT=new A.aR(69,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064e\u0627\u0637\u0650\u0646\u064f","Al-Batin","Le Cach\xe9","The Hidden","Celui dont l'essence est compl\xe8tement cach\xe9e et transcendante, imperceptible aux sens. Il est au-del\xe0 de toute compr\xe9hension cr\xe9\xe9e.","The One whose essence is completely hidden and transcendent, imperceptible to the senses. He is beyond all created understanding.","Accepter ce nom apaise le c\u0153ur en acceptant que les myst\xe8res divins d\xe9passent la compr\xe9hension humaine.","Accepting this name soothes the heart by accepting that divine mysteries transcend human understanding.")
B.afz=new A.aR(70,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0650\u064a","Al-Wali","Le Souverain","The Sovereign","Celui qui gouverne absolument et qui est le ma\xeetre supr\xeame. Il administre les affaires de l'univers avec sagesse et justice.","The One who governs absolutely and is the supreme master. He administers the affairs of the universe with wisdom and justice.","Celui qui accepte l'autorit\xe9 de ce nom dans sa vie trouvera ordre et justice dans les circonstances apparemment chaotiques.","Those who accept the authority of this name in their life will find order and justice in seemingly chaotic circumstances.")
B.afv=new A.aR(71,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u062a\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0650\u064a","Al-Mutaali","L'Infiniment Haut","The Most High","Celui qui transcende absolument toute cr\xe9ation par sa hauteur et sa gloire. Il est \xe9lev\xe9 au-del\xe0 de toute comparaison et ressemblance.","The One who absolutely transcends all creation by His height and glory. He is exalted beyond all comparison and resemblance.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom enseigne l'humilit\xe9 authentique en reconnaissant l'immense distance entre la cr\xe9ature et le Cr\xe9ateur.","Meditating on this name teaches authentic humility by recognizing the immense distance between the creature and the Creator.")
B.afH=new A.aR(72,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u0650\u0631\u064f\u0651","Al-Bir","La Vertu","The Good","Celui qui est bon et bienveillant envers sa cr\xe9ation, qui manifeste la g\xe9n\xe9rosit\xe9 et la justice. Sa bont\xe9 est constante et sans limite.","The One who is good and benevolent toward His creation, who manifests generosity and justice. His goodness is constant and limitless.","Celui qui invoque ce nom avec sinc\xe9rit\xe9 d\xe9veloppera la compassion envers autrui et la bont\xe9 deviendra sa nature.","Those who invoke this name with sincerity will develop compassion toward others and goodness will become their nature.")
B.afj=new A.aR(73,"\u0627\u0644\u062a\u064e\u0651\u0648\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0628\u064f","At-Tawwab","Celui Qui Pardonne","The Pardoning","Celui qui accepte le repentir de ses serviteurs et qui les r\xe9admet continuellement dans sa gr\xe2ce. Son pardon ne s'\xe9puise jamais.","The One who accepts the repentance of His servants and continuously readmits them into His grace. His forgiveness never runs out.","Celui qui se repent sinc\xe8rement en invoquant ce nom trouvera la porte du pardon toujours ouverte \xe0 son retour.","Those who sincerely repent while invoking this name will find the door of forgiveness always open to their return.")
B.afB=new A.aR(74,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0641\u0650\u064a\u0638\u064f","Al-Hafiz","Le Gardien","The Guardian","Celui qui garde et prot\xe8ge sa cr\xe9ation du changement, de l'oubli et de la destruction. Il pr\xe9serve tout ce qui existe.","The One who guards and protects His creation from change, oblivion, and destruction. He preserves all that exists.","Celui qui place sa confiance en ce nom verra ses affaires prot\xe9g\xe9es et ses int\xe9r\xeats pr\xe9serv\xe9s par le gardien divin.","Those who place their trust in this name will see their affairs protected and their interests preserved by the divine guardian.")
B.aen=new A.aR(75,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0650\u064a","Al-Ali","Le Sublime","The Sublime","Celui qui est supr\xeamement \xe9lev\xe9 en essence, en attributs et en actions. Toute \xe9l\xe9vation cr\xe9\xe9e lui est soumise et inf\xe9rieure.","The One who is supremely exalted in essence, attributes, and actions. All created elevation is subject to and inferior to Him.","R\xe9citer ce nom \xe9l\xe8ve l'\xe2me vers les r\xe9alit\xe9s spirituelles sup\xe9rieures et d\xe9tache du mat\xe9rialisme terrestre.","Reciting this name elevates the soul toward higher spiritual realities and detaches from worldly materialism.")
B.aft=new A.aR(76,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0623\u064e\u0643\u0652\u0631\u064e\u0645\u064f","Al-Akram","Le Plus Noble","The Most Generous","Celui qui poss\xe8de la noblesse supr\xeame et la g\xe9n\xe9rosit\xe9 absolue. Sa magnificence transcende toute concept de noblesse cr\xe9\xe9e.","The One who possesses supreme nobility and absolute generosity. His magnificence transcends all concepts of created nobility.","Celui qui demande la noblesse de caract\xe8re en invoquant ce nom recevra l'honneur v\xe9ritable de l'int\xe9grit\xe9 morale.","Those who ask for nobility of character while invoking this name will receive true honor through moral integrity.")
B.aeY=new A.aR(77,"\u0627\u064e\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u0642\u0650\u064a\u0628","Ar-Raqib","Le Vigilant","The Alert","Celui qui surveille constamment et attention toutes ses cr\xe9atures. Aucune action n'\xe9chappe \xe0 sa vigilance constante.","The One who watches constantly and attentively all His creatures. No action escapes His constant vigilance.","Sachant qu'il est vigilant, le serviteur purifiera ses actions internes et maintiendra l'int\xe9grit\xe9 en secret comme en public.","Knowing He is vigilant, the servant will purify his inner actions and maintain integrity in secret as in public.")
B.afp=new A.aR(78,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0645","Al-Qiyam","Celui Qui G\xe8re","The Maintainer","Celui qui g\xe8re et administre les affaires de sa cr\xe9ation sans cesse. Il maintient l'ordre de l'univers par son gestion sagesse.","The One who manages and administers the affairs of His creation continuously. He maintains the order of the universe through wise administration.","Invoquer ce nom apaise l'inqui\xe9tude en reconnaissant que la gestion de tous les affaires appartient ultimement \xe0 Dieu.","Invoking this name soothes anxiety by recognizing that the management of all affairs ultimately belongs to God.")
B.aeZ=new A.aR(79,"\u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u0642\u0650\u064a\u0642\u064f","Ar-Raqiq","Le D\xe9licat","The Subtle","Celui dont la mis\xe9ricorde est d\xe9licate et subtile, qui touche le c\u0153ur doucement. Sa bont\xe9 couvre les cr\xe9atures avec une tendresse infinie.","The One whose mercy is delicate and subtle, who touches the heart gently. His goodness covers creatures with infinite tenderness.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom apaise le c\u0153ur bless\xe9 en le remplissant de la tendresse infinie de la mis\xe9ricorde divine.","Meditating on this name soothes the wounded heart by filling it with the infinite tenderness of divine mercy.")
B.aff=new A.aR(80,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064e\u062f\u0650\u064a\u0631\u064f","Al-Qadir","Le Puissant","The Powerful","Celui qui poss\xe8de le pouvoir absolu et qui peut accomplir toute chose. Aucune difficult\xe9 ne peut le d\xe9passer.","The One who possesses absolute power and can accomplish all things. No difficulty can surpass Him.","Celui qui se tourne vers ce nom en cas de difficult\xe9 trouvera la force et la capacit\xe9 de surmonter n'importe quel obstacle.","Those who turn to this name in difficulty will find the strength and ability to overcome any obstacle.")
B.afA=new A.aR(81,"\u0627\u0644\u0633\u0650\u0651\u062a\u0650\u0651\u064a\u0631\u064f","As-Sittir","Celui Qui Voile","The Concealer","Celui qui voile les fautes de ses serviteurs et ne les expose pas publiquement. Il couvre avec mis\xe9ricorde les d\xe9fauts de ses cr\xe9atures.","The One who conceals the faults of His servants and does not expose them publicly. He covers with mercy the defects of His creatures.","Celui qui garde les secrets des autres et voile leurs d\xe9fauts recevra le voilement divin sur ses propres fautes.","Those who keep the secrets of others and conceal their faults will receive divine concealment of their own faults.")
B.aeK=new A.aR(82,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0641\u064f\u0648\u064f\u0651","Al-Afu","Celui Qui Pardonne","The Pardoner","Celui qui pardonne largement et efface les p\xe9ch\xe9s enti\xe8rement, qui annule le ch\xe2timent m\xe9rit\xe9. Son pardon est complet.","The One who forgives widely and erases sins completely, who cancels deserved punishment. His forgiveness is complete.","Celui qui pardonne sinc\xe8rement aux autres en invoquant ce nom recevra le pardon complet de ses propres erreurs.","Those who sincerely forgive others while invoking this name will receive complete forgiveness of their own mistakes.")
B.aeA=new A.aR(83,"\u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u0624\u064f\u0648\u0641\u064f","Ar-Rauf","Celui Qui est Doux","The Clement","Celui qui manifeste une douceur et une tendresse extr\xeames dans sa mis\xe9ricorde. Son traitement est plein de compassion d\xe9licate.","The One who manifests extreme gentleness and tenderness in His mercy. His treatment is full of delicate compassion.","Celui qui se repent en invoquant ce nom trouvera Dieu doux et compatissant envers ses d\xe9fauts et son faiblesses.","Those who repent while invoking this name will find God gentle and compassionate toward their faults and weaknesses.")
B.aeR=new A.aR(84,"\u0645\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0650\u0643\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0644\u0652\u0643\u0650","Malik-ul-Mulk","Le Ma\xeetre du Domaine","The Master of the Kingdom","Celui qui poss\xe8de la royaut\xe9 et la domination absolues. Tout pouvoir cr\xe9\xe9 est un emprunt temporaire de sa royaut\xe9 \xe9ternelle.","The One who possesses absolute kingdom and dominion. All created power is a temporary loan from His eternal kingdom.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom purifie le c\u0153ur de l'attachement aux pouvoirs terrestres temporels et oriente vers l'\xe9ternel.","Meditating on this name purifies the heart from attachment to temporal earthly powers and directs toward the eternal.")
B.af0=new A.aR(85,"\u0630\u064f\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0652\u062c\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0650 \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0625\u0650\u0643\u0652\u0631\u064e\u0627\u0645\u0650","Dhu-al-Jalal wa-al-Ikram","Possesseur de Gloire et d'Honneur","Possessor of Majesty and Honor","Celui qui poss\xe8de une gloire majestueuse et une grandeur honorable. Ses gloire et honneur sont absolus et inviolables.","The One who possesses majestic glory and honorable greatness. His glory and honor are absolute and inviolable.","R\xe9citer ce nom avec r\xe9v\xe9rence renforce le respect divin et \xe9l\xe8ve l'\xe2me vers la contemplation de la magnificence divine.","Reciting this name with reverence strengthens divine respect and elevates the soul toward contemplating divine magnificence.")
B.afd=new A.aR(86,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0642\u0652\u0633\u0650\u0637\u064f","Al-Muqsit","Celui Qui Rend Justice","The Just","Celui qui rend justice avec \xe9quit\xe9 et impartialit\xe9 \xe0 tous ses serviteurs. Sa justice est parfaite et sans favoritisme.","The One who renders justice with equity and impartiality to all His servants. His justice is perfect and without favoritism.","Celui qui demande la justice en invoquant ce nom verra l'\xe9quit\xe9 triompher m\xeame si la tyrannie semble temporairement dominante.","Those who seek justice while invoking this name will see equity triumph even if tyranny seems temporarily dominant.")
B.afc=new A.aR(87,"\u0627\u0644\u062c\u064e\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0639\u064f","Al-Jami","Celui Qui Rassemble","The Gatherer","Celui qui rassemble toutes choses et rassemble l'humanit\xe9 pour le jugement. Il unifie et coordonne l'ordre de l'univers.","The One who gathers all things and assembles humanity for judgment. He unifies and coordinates the order of the universe.","Invoquer ce nom attire l'unit\xe9 et la coh\xe9sion dans les affaires fragment\xe9es et dispers\xe9es du serviteur.","Invoking this name attracts unity and cohesion in the fragmented and scattered affairs of the servant.")
B.afP=new A.aR(88,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u063a\u064e\u0646\u0650\u064a\u064f\u0651","Al-Ghani","Le Riche","The Rich","Celui qui est compl\xe8tement exempt du besoin et qui est autosuffisant absolument. Sa richesse infinie contraste avec la pauvret\xe9 cr\xe9\xe9e.","The One who is completely free from need and absolutely self-sufficient. His infinite wealth contrasts with created poverty.","Celui qui m\xe9dite sur ce nom comprendra la v\xe9ritable pauvret\xe9 de la cr\xe9ation et se lib\xe8rera de l'avidit\xe9 mat\xe9rielle.","Those who meditate on this name will understand the true poverty of creation and free themselves from material greed.")
B.aez=new A.aR(89,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u063a\u0652\u0646\u0650\u064a","Al-Moughni","Celui Qui Enrichit","The Enricher","Celui qui enrichit ses serviteurs et pourvoit \xe0 leur suffisance. Il est la source de toute abondance cr\xe9\xe9e.","The One who enriches His servants and provides for their sufficiency. He is the source of all created abundance.","Celui qui invoque ce nom r\xe9guli\xe8rement avec gratitude attirera l'enrichissement spirituel et mat\xe9riel dans sa vie.","Those who regularly invoke this name with gratitude will attract spiritual and material enrichment into their life.")
B.aem=new A.aR(90,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0627\u0646\u0650\u0639\u064f","Al-Mani","Celui Qui Refuse","The Withholder","Celui qui retient et refuse ses faveurs selon sa sagesse. Il peut emp\xeacher le mal d'atteindre ses serviteurs.","The One who withholds and refuses His favors according to His wisdom. He can prevent harm from reaching His servants.","Accepter ce nom apaise le c\u0153ur en sachant que tout refus ou privation peut contenir une protection divine.","Accepting this name soothes the heart knowing that any refusal or deprivation may contain divine protection.")
B.aeP=new A.aR(91,"\u0627\u0644\u0636\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0631\u064f\u0651","Ad-Dar","Celui Qui Nuit","The Harmer","Celui qui cause le dommage et la souffrance selon sa sagesse et sa justice. Tout mal vient de lui selon le d\xe9cret divin.","The One who causes harm and suffering according to His wisdom and justice. All harm comes from Him according to divine decree.","Celui qui accepte ce nom avec patience et sinc\xe9rit\xe9 trouvera dans le dommage apparent une mis\xe9ricorde cach\xe9e et une correction divine.","Those who accept this name with patience and sincerity will find hidden mercy and divine correction in apparent harm.")
B.aeI=new A.aR(92,"\u0627\u0644\u0646\u064e\u0651\u0627\u0641\u0650\u0639\u064f","An-Nafi","Celui Qui B\xe9n\xe9ficie","The Benefiter","Celui qui procure le b\xe9n\xe9fice et l'avantage \xe0 qui il veut. Tout bien et profit vient uniquement de sa volont\xe9.","The One who bestows benefit and advantage to whom He wills. All good and profit come only from His will.","Celui qui demande le b\xe9n\xe9fice en invoquant ce nom verra les portes du profit et de l'utilit\xe9 s'ouvrir pour lui.","Those who seek benefit while invoking this name will see doors of profit and utility open for them.")
B.aey=new A.aR(93,"\u0627\u0644\u0646\u064f\u0651\u0648\u0631\u064f","An-Nur","La Lumi\xe8re","The Light","Celui qui est la source de toute lumi\xe8re physique et spirituelle. Sa lumi\xe8re illumine tous les univers et les esprits.","The One who is the source of all physical and spiritual light. His light illuminates all universes and spirits.","Celui qui demande l'illumination du c\u0153ur en invoquant ce nom trouvera guidance et clart\xe9 dans les affaires obscures.","Those who ask for heart illumination while invoking this name will find guidance and clarity in obscure matters.")
B.afa=new A.aR(94,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0647\u064e\u0627\u062f\u0650\u064a","Al-Hadi","Le Guide","The Guide","Celui qui guide ses cr\xe9atures vers le chemin droit et vers lui-m\xeame. Sa guidance est parfaite et sans erreur.","The One who guides His creatures toward the straight path and toward Himself. His guidance is perfect and without error.","Celui qui demande la guidance sinc\xe8rement en invoquant ce nom sera dirig\xe9 vers le chemin de la v\xe9rit\xe9 et de la rectitude.","Those who sincerely seek guidance while invoking this name will be directed toward the path of truth and righteousness.")
B.afh=new A.aR(95,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064e\u062f\u0650\u064a\u0639\u064f","Al-Badi","Celui Qui Cr\xe9e l'Impr\xe9vu","The Originator","Celui qui cr\xe9e des choses merveilleuses et sans pr\xe9c\xe9dent. Il combine les cr\xe9ations de mani\xe8re surprenante et originale.","The One who creates wondrous and unprecedented things. He combines creations in surprising and original ways.","M\xe9diter sur ce nom remplit le c\u0153ur de l'\xe9merveillement devant l'infinie cr\xe9ativit\xe9 divine et l'unicit\xe9 de chaque cr\xe9ature.","Meditating on this name fills the heart with wonder at infinite divine creativity and the uniqueness of each creature.")
B.af8=new A.aR(96,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064e\u0627\u0642\u0650\u064a","Al-Baqi","L'\xc9ternel","The Eternal","Celui qui demeure et persiste \xe9ternellement, tandis que toute cr\xe9ation dispara\xeet. Son existence \xe9ternelle transcende le temps.","The One who endures and persists eternally, while all creation perishes. His eternal existence transcends time.","R\xe9citer ce nom pr\xe9pare le c\u0153ur \xe0 l'\xe9ternit\xe9 en rappelant que seule la permanence divine m\xe9rite l'attachement v\xe9ritable.","Reciting this name prepares the heart for eternity by reminding that only divine permanence deserves true attachment.")
B.aep=new A.aR(97,"\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0627\u0631\u0650\u062b\u064f","Al-Warith","L'H\xe9ritier","The Inheritor","Celui qui h\xe9ritera de toute cr\xe9ation apr\xe8s sa fin. \xc0 la fin, seul il demeurera \xe9ternel apr\xe8s la destruction de tout.","The One who will inherit all creation after its end. In the end, only He will remain eternal after the destruction of everything.","Celui qui comprend ce nom renonce \xe0 l'attachement aux biens terrestres sachant que l'h\xe9ritage final appartient \xe0 Dieu seul.","Those who understand this name will renounce attachment to earthly possessions knowing the final inheritance belongs to God alone.")
B.afG=new A.aR(98,"\u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u0634\u0650\u064a\u062f\u064f","Ar-Rashid","Celui Qui Conseille","The Rightly-Guided","Celui qui guide vers la rectitude et le bon conseil divin. Sa guidance est juste et exempte d'erreur.","The One who guides toward rectitude and divine counsel. His guidance is just and free from error.","Celui qui demande le bon conseil en invoquant ce nom recevra la guidance vers les meilleures d\xe9cisions et actions.","Those who seek good counsel while invoking this name will receive guidance toward the best decisions and actions.")
B.aeW=new A.aR(99,"\u0627\u0644\u0635\u064e\u0651\u0628\u064f\u0648\u0631\u064f","As-Sabur","Le Patient","The Patient","Celui qui tol\xe8re les p\xe9ch\xe9s de ses cr\xe9atures sans se h\xe2ter \xe0 les ch\xe2tier. Sa patience infinie permet la repentance et l'am\xe9lioration.","The One who tolerates the sins of His creatures without hastening to punish them. His infinite patience allows for repentance and improvement.","Celui qui demande la patience en invoquant ce nom d\xe9veloppera la endurance spirituelle et morale face aux \xe9preuves de la vie.","Those who ask for patience while invoking this name will develop spiritual and moral endurance in facing life's trials.")
