B.aCL=new A.oP("\ud83c\udccf","Chaque joueur voit son mot en secret",null)
B.aCN=new A.oP("\ud83d\ude08","Le Kadhab re\xe7oit un mot diff\xe9rent",null)
B.aCO=new A.oP("\ud83d\udde3","Chacun donne un indice \xe0 tour de r\xf4le",null)
B.aCM=new A.oP("\ud83d\udeab","Le Kadhab ne parle pas en premier",null)
B.aCJ=new A.oP("\ud83d\uddf3","Vote : le plus suspect est \xe9limin\xe9",null)
B.aCK=new A.oP("\ud83c\udfc6","Trouvez le Kadhab avant qu'il gagne !",null)
B.a8o=s([B.axD,B.C,B.aCL,B.aCN,B.aCO,B.aCM,B.aCJ,B.aCK],t.p)
B.be=new A.jh(0,"motivation")
B.V9=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83d\udcaa","Tu es sur la bonne voie !","Chaque petit pas compte. Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit : \xab Les actes les plus aim\xe9s d'Allah sont les plus r\xe9guliers, m\xeame s'ils sont peu nombreux. \xbb Allez, on continue ensemble ?","Continuer","learning","You're on the right path!",'Every little step counts. The Prophet \ufdfa said: "The deeds most beloved to Allah are the most regular, even if they are small." Come on, let\'s keep going together?',"Continue")
B.UK=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udf1f","Hey, \xe7a fait plaisir de te voir !","Tu sais quoi ? Le simple fait d'ouvrir UpYourDeen, c'est d\xe9j\xe0 une intention de bien. Et Allah r\xe9compense les intentions. Tu veux lire un verset aujourd'hui ?","Lire le Coran","quran","Hey, nice to see you!","You know what? Simply opening UpYourDeen is already a good intention. And Allah rewards intentions. Want to read a verse today?","Read the Quran")
B.Ul=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83d\udcd6","Un verset, \xe7a change une journ\xe9e","S\xe9rieusement, m\xeame un seul verset lu avec le c\u0153ur peut illuminer ta journ\xe9e enti\xe8re. Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit que celui qui lit le Coran avec difficult\xe9 a une double r\xe9compense. Tu es doublement r\xe9compens\xe9(e) !","Lire un verset","quran","One verse can change your day","Seriously, even a single verse read with intention can light up your entire day. The Prophet \ufdfa said that whoever reads the Quran with difficulty gets a double reward. You're doubly rewarded!","Read a verse")
B.Ud=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83e\udd32","Allah est fier de toi","Tu cherches \xe0 apprendre, \xe0 comprendre, \xe0 t'am\xe9liorer. C'est exactement ce qu'Allah aime. \xab Et quiconque emprunte un chemin pour acqu\xe9rir un savoir, Allah lui facilite un chemin vers le Paradis. \xbb","Apprendre","learning","Allah is proud of you",'You seek to learn, understand, and improve. That\'s exactly what Allah loves. "And whoever takes a path to seek knowledge, Allah will ease for them a path to Paradise."',"Learn")
B.VD=new A.aO(B.be,"\u2728","Petit rappel entre amis","M\xeame les Compagnons du Proph\xe8te \ufdfa se rappelaient les uns les autres. Consid\xe8re-moi comme ton compagnon de route. On avance ensemble, \xe0 ton rythme, sans pression.",null,null,"A little reminder between friends","Even the Prophet's \ufdfa Companions reminded each other. Think of me as your companion on the journey. We're moving forward together, at your own pace, no pressure.",null)
B.UU=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udf19","La nuit porte conseil... et b\xe9n\xe9dictions","Si tu lis \xe7a le soir, sache que le dernier tiers de la nuit est le moment o\xf9 Allah descend au ciel le plus proche et dit : \xab Y a-t-il quelqu'un qui M'invoque pour que Je lui r\xe9ponde ? \xbb Tu as une du'a \xe0 faire ?",null,null,"The night brings wisdom... and blessings","If you're reading this in the evening, know that the last third of the night is when Allah descends to the nearest heaven and says: \"Is there anyone who calls upon Me so I may answer?\" Do you have a du'a to make?",null)
B.Ue=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f","Tu n'es jamais seul(e)","\xab Il est avec vous o\xf9 que vous soyez. \xbb (Al-Hadid 57:4). M\xeame dans les moments difficiles, Allah est l\xe0. Et moi aussi, je suis l\xe0 dans ta poche. \ud83d\ude0a",null,null,"You're never alone",'"He is with you wherever you are." (Al-Hadid 57:4). Even in difficult moments, Allah is there. And I\'m here in your pocket too. \ud83d\ude0a',null)
B.UH=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udf3a","Chaque jour est un nouveau d\xe9part","En Islam, chaque aube est une chance de recommencer. Tu n'as pas lu hier ? Pas grave. Tu n'as pas pri\xe9 \xe0 l'heure ? Recommence maintenant. Allah aime ceux qui se repentent et qui se purifient.","Reprendre","learning","Every day is a fresh start","In Islam, every dawn is a chance to start again. Didn't read yesterday? No worries. Didn't pray on time? Start now. Allah loves those who repent and purify themselves.","Restart")
B.Vz=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udfc3","Pas besoin d'\xeatre parfait","Allah ne te demande pas la perfection. Il te demande l'effort. Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit : \xab Rapprochez-vous de la perfection, rectifiez, et r\xe9jouissez-vous. \xbb L'important c'est d'avancer.","Avancer","learning","No need to be perfect",'Allah doesn\'t ask for perfection. He asks for effort. The Prophet \ufdfa said: "Aim for perfection, rectify yourselves, and rejoice." What matters is moving forward.',"Move forward")
B.V6=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83d\udc8e","Tu vaux plus que tu ne crois","Allah t'a cr\xe9\xe9(e) avec un but. Tu n'es pas l\xe0 par hasard. Chaque seconde que tu passes \xe0 apprendre ta religion, c'est un investissement \xe9ternel. Pas mal comme rendement, non ?",null,null,"You're worth more than you think","Allah created you with a purpose. You're not here by chance. Every second you spend learning your faith is an eternal investment. Not a bad return, right?",null)
B.Vt=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f","Le savoir est une lumi\xe8re","L'Imam ash-Shafi'i a dit : \xab Le savoir est une lumi\xe8re, et la lumi\xe8re d'Allah n'est pas donn\xe9e au p\xe9cheur. \xbb En cherchant le savoir, tu allumes ta propre lumi\xe8re.","S'illuminer","learning","Knowledge is light","Imam ash-Shafi'i said: \"Knowledge is light, and Allah's light is not given to the sinful.\" By seeking knowledge, you're lighting your own light.","Illuminate")
B.UF=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83e\udd81","Tu es plus fort(e) que tu ne penses","Umar ibn al-Khattab est pass\xe9 de pers\xe9cuteur \xe0 pilier de l'Islam. Le changement est toujours possible. Si lui a pu transformer sa vie, toi aussi tu peux apprendre et grandir.",null,null,"You're stronger than you think","Umar ibn al-Khattab went from persecutor to pillar of Islam. Change is always possible. If he could transform his life, so can you learn and grow.",null)
B.UZ=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udf93","L'encre du savant...","...est plus pr\xe9cieuse que le sang du martyr. Tu le savais ? En apprenant, tu accomplis un acte de d\xe9votion immense. Continue, chaque connaissance est un tr\xe9sor.","Apprendre","learning","The ink of the scholar...","...is more precious than the blood of the martyr. Did you know? By learning, you're performing an immense act of worship. Keep going, every piece of knowledge is a treasure.","Learn")
B.Vw=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udf3b","Le meilleur moment c'est maintenant","On reporte toujours \xe0 demain. Mais demain n'est promis \xe0 personne. 5 minutes de Coran maintenant valent mieux que 2 heures que tu ne feras jamais. On y va ?","5 minutes","quran","The best time is now","We always put it off until tomorrow. But tomorrow is promised to no one. 5 minutes of Quran now is worth more than 2 hours you'll never do. Let's go?","5 minutes")
B.UN=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83d\udd11","La patience est la cl\xe9","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit : \xab Celui qui patiente, Allah lui donnera la patience. Et personne n'a re\xe7u de don meilleur et plus vaste que la patience. \xbb Tu es en train de construire quelque chose de beau.",null,null,"Patience is the key",'The Prophet \ufdfa said: "Whoever has patience, Allah will give them patience. And no one has been given a better and greater gift than patience." You\'re building something beautiful.',null)
B.Uk=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udf08","Apr\xe8s la pluie...","...le beau temps. Apr\xe8s la difficult\xe9, la facilit\xe9. C'est la promesse d'Allah, r\xe9p\xe9t\xe9e deux fois dans sourate Ash-Sharh. Si c'est dur en ce moment, tiens bon. Le soulagement arrive.",null,null,"After the rain...","...comes the sun. After difficulty comes ease. This is Allah's promise, repeated twice in Surah Ash-Sharh. If things are hard right now, hold on. Relief is coming.",null)
B.V7=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83d\udcda","Les anges t'accompagnent","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit : \xab Quand des gens se r\xe9unissent pour \xe9tudier le Livre d'Allah, la s\xe9r\xe9nit\xe9 descend sur eux, la mis\xe9ricorde les enveloppe et les anges les entourent. \xbb Tu n'es pas seul(e) !","\xc9tudier","quran","The angels are with you","The Prophet \ufdfa said: \"When people gather to study Allah's Book, tranquility descends upon them, mercy envelops them, and the angels surround them.\" You're not alone!","Study")
B.VE=new A.aO(B.be,"\u26f0\ufe0f","Sommet apr\xe8s sommet","Le chemin de la connaissance, c'est comme gravir une montagne. Parfois c'est dur, parfois tu veux abandonner. Mais la vue d'en haut... SubhanAllah. Continue \xe0 grimper.",null,null,"Peak after peak","The path to knowledge is like climbing a mountain. Sometimes it's hard, sometimes you want to give up. But the view from the top... SubhanAllah. Keep climbing.",null)
B.UT=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83d\udd4b","Chaque pas compte","Le p\xe8lerin qui marche vers la Ka'ba ne la voit pas au d\xe9but. Mais il sait qu'elle est l\xe0. Chaque pas d'apprentissage te rapproche d'Allah, m\xeame si tu ne vois pas encore le r\xe9sultat.",null,null,"Every step counts","The pilgrim walking toward the Kaaba doesn't see it at first. But they know it's there. Every step of learning brings you closer to Allah, even if you don't see the result yet.",null)
B.VF=new A.aO(B.be,"\ud83c\udf34","Comme un palmier","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a compar\xe9 le croyant \xe0 un palmier : utile en toute saison, r\xe9sistant aux temp\xeates, et dont chaque partie est b\xe9n\xe9fique. En apprenant, tu deviens ce palmier.","Grandir","learning","Like a palm tree","The Prophet \ufdfa compared the believer to a palm tree: useful in every season, resistant to storms, and every part is beneficial. By learning, you become that palm tree.","Grow")
B.a8r=s([B.V9,B.UK,B.Ul,B.Ud,B.VD,B.UU,B.Ue,B.UH,B.Vz,B.V6,B.Vt,B.UF,B.UZ,B.Vw,B.UN,B.Uk,B.V7,B.VE,B.UT,B.VF],t.Vt)
