B.alv=new A.eI("La patience n'est pas de supporter passivement, c'est d'accepter avec confiance que le plan d'Allah est meilleur que le tien.","Patience is not passive endurance; it is accepting with trust that Allah's plan is better than yours.","Ibn al-Qayyim","patience","\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f")
B.alo=new A.eI("Sois patient, car la pluie ne tombe pas sur une seule terre.","Be patient, for rain does not fall on only one land.","Proverbe arabe","patience","\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f")
B.alk=new A.eI("Le vrai fort n'est pas celui qui terrasse son adversaire, mais celui qui se ma\xeetrise dans la col\xe8re.","The truly strong person is not the one who defeats his opponent, but the one who controls himself in anger.","Proph\xe8te Muhammad \ufdfa \u2014 Bukhari","patience","\ud83d\udcaa")
B.als=new A.eI("Si vous placiez votre confiance en Allah comme il se doit, Il vous nourrirait comme Il nourrit les oiseaux : ils partent le ventre vide et reviennent le ventre plein.","If you were to truly rely on Allah as He deserves, He would provide for you as He provides for the birds: they leave hungry and return satisfied.","Proph\xe8te Muhammad \ufdfa \u2014 Tirmidhi","tawakkul","\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f")
B.alx=new A.eI("Quand Allah veut du bien pour quelqu'un, Il lui ouvre la porte de l'action et lui ferme la porte du d\xe9bat.","When Allah wants good for someone, He opens for them the door of action and closes the door of debate.","Hassan al-Basri","tawakkul","\ud83c\udf05")
B.alr=new A.eI("Ne sois pas triste, ce que tu as perdu reviendra sous une autre forme.","Do not be sad; what you have lost will return in another form.","Rumi","tawakkul","\ud83c\udf19")
B.alm=new A.eI("Cherchez la science du berceau jusqu'\xe0 la tombe.","Seek knowledge from the cradle to the grave.","Proverbe islamique","science","\ud83d\udcda")
B.alt=new A.eI("L'encre du savant est plus sacr\xe9e que le sang du martyr.","The ink of a scholar is more sacred than the blood of a martyr.","Attribu\xe9 au Proph\xe8te \ufdfa","science","\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f")
B.aly=new A.eI("Celui qui ne go\xfbte pas l'amertume de l'apprentissage pendant un moment, go\xfbtera l'humiliation de l'ignorance toute sa vie.","Whoever does not taste the bitterness of learning for a while will taste the humiliation of ignorance all his life.","Imam Ash-Shafi'i","science","\ud83e\udde0")
B.alq=new A.eI("Le meilleur d'entre vous est celui qui est le meilleur envers sa famille, et je suis le meilleur d'entre vous envers ma famille.","The best of you are those who are best to their families, and I am the best of you to my family.","Proph\xe8te Muhammad \ufdfa \u2014 Tirmidhi","famille","\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67")
B.all=new A.eI("Et parmi Ses signes, Il a cr\xe9\xe9 pour vous des \xe9pouses issues de vous-m\xeames pour que vous trouviez la qui\xe9tude aupr\xe8s d'elles.","And of His signs is that He created for you from yourselves mates that you may find tranquility in them.","Coran, Ar-Rum 30:21","famille","\ud83d\udc9e")
B.alj=new A.eI("\xd4 fils d'Adam, tant que tu M'invoques et que tu esp\xe8res en Moi, Je te pardonne quoi que tu aies fait, et cela ne Me p\xe8se pas.","O son of Adam, as long as you call upon Me and hope in Me, I will forgive you for what you have done, and I do not mind.","Hadith Qudsi \u2014 Tirmidhi","repentir","\ud83c\udf31")
B.alw=new A.eI("Allah se r\xe9jouit du repentir de Son serviteur plus que celui qui retrouve son chameau perdu dans le d\xe9sert.","Allah rejoices more at the repentance of His servant than a person who finds his lost camel in the desert.","Proph\xe8te Muhammad \ufdfa \u2014 Muslim","repentir","\ud83c\udf0a")
B.alp=new A.eI("Chaque fils d'Adam commet des erreurs, et les meilleurs parmi ceux qui commettent des erreurs sont ceux qui se repentent.","Every son of Adam commits mistakes, and the best of those who make mistakes are those who repent.","Proph\xe8te Muhammad \ufdfa \u2014 Tirmidhi","repentir","\ud83d\udd04")
B.alu=new A.eI("Dans le c\u0153ur, il y a un vide qui ne peut \xeatre combl\xe9 que par l'amour d'Allah, le fait de se tourner vers Lui et de Le mentionner constamment.","In the heart there is a void that cannot be filled except by the love of Allah, turning to Him and constantly remembering Him.","Ibn al-Qayyim","amour","\ud83d\udc9a")
B.aln=new A.eI("Allah est beau et Il aime la beaut\xe9.","Allah is beautiful and He loves beauty.","Proph\xe8te Muhammad \ufdfa \u2014 Muslim","amour","\ud83c\udf3a")
